Domain-specific ApplicationError subclasses go here (e.g. AppointmentSlotConflictError,
TechnicianNotQualifiedError) once the scheduler domain exists — see
directives/domain_modeling.md for the pattern (extend ApplicationError from
@scheduler/shared-kernel, set `statusCode` + `code`). Empty at init: this repo has no
business logic yet (.ai/plans/init-source.plan.md §8).
